Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Phase II \[LongDash] Polynomial Derivation", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"e86011be-df38-4399-875e-06feb9fe1726"],

Cell["\<\
Phase II starts from the frozen Phase I nondimensional expression and derives \
a degree-14 polynomial candidate. The theorem is one-way: D*Lambda(s) == 0 \
implies P14(s) == 0 on the admissible domain. The reverse implication is not \
claimed.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4b6305a3-77b5-4b9f-9c9e-54baec0bedc4"],

Cell["\<\
Load the Phase II audit using a path relative to NotebookDirectory[]. The \
audit is separate from the frozen Phase I audit entry point.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7a66e653-9732-4d92-90cc-66077353685b"],

