Cell["Derivation-step audit", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"14e7325a-c51f-442b-aca2-985329fbccba"],

Cell["\<\
Every step records its operation class, whether it preserves only forward \
implication, and whether spurious roots may enter.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1bb9cc56-2dfd-4308-ac8a-b6729b1f562e"],

